A directive with both an invalid name and a trailing argument reports the
invalid name, which is the more fundamental fault (the name is checked first).
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
error-is: ErrInvalidSetName
-- example.com/app/a.go --
package app

type T struct{}

//plumb:123 extra
func A() *T { return nil }
